{
  "epId": 10967,
  "name": "桑多涅的便携式茶桌",
  "desc": "桑多涅赠予你的便携式茶桌。方便携带、易于收纳，甚至还加装了悬浮装置。几乎能在任何地方享受闲暇的茶会时光。",
  "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/06/29/8fa465ce5018dc6fb89ca4636f28e12c_4605284369813192294.png",
  "menuId": 9,
  "menuName": "提瓦特物产",
  "version": 1786020989,
  "components": {
    "customize": [
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "玩法教学"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/4d581a19baf5823acf774aa095eda43d_5866158806238870608.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "打开背包，在小道具页面装备「桑多涅的便携式茶桌」，点击道具下方的 <color=#ffe04b>「茶会笔记」</color> 按钮，能够开启茶会。\n注意： <color=#ffe04b>推荐完成</color> 魔神任务——空月之歌·第十幕「道成千壑，因果异灭」，及「映夏！归乡？千灵节！」后开启茶会剧情，以获得最佳体验。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/d49834346b9d203185fef2d955f8e697_7528498686719786186.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在「茶会笔记」页面，能够选择想要邀请的角色参加茶会，并发出邀请。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/c26f7b04bacdb181a96295d05fb42c52_2747840828156804575.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "向角色发出邀请后，根据提示前往适当的位置。放置小道具「桑多涅的便携式茶桌」，并 <color=#ffe04b>使用桑多涅落座</color> 后，开启茶会。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomImage",
        "url": "https:/act-upload.hoyoverse.com/event-ugc-hoyowiki/2026/07/06/237301566/4de4f6389e1faea0f532dfbe3c957212_8982821967273457686.png",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "在任务所指引的黄圈范围内 <color=#ffe04b>寻找符合任务描述的地点</color> ，放置茶桌并使用桑多涅落座，方能开启茶会。已完成的茶会内容，能够在「茶会笔记」中进行回顾。",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "茶会笔记"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "<color=#ffffff>邀请角色</color>\n<color=#ffffff>任务</color>",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
